OL,3,GNEWSABoots sold in #7bn deal to
OL,4,ACanadian billionaire family
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoots, the High Street pharmacy and
OL,7,Fretail chain, has been sold in an
OL,8,F$8.9bn (#6.7bn) deal to Canada's
OL,9,Fbillionaire Weston family.
OL,11,FWittington Investments, the holding
OL,12,Fcompany, confirmed it had agreed to buy
OL,13,F177-year old company on Wednesday from
OL,14,FUS private equity firm Sycamore
OL,15,FPartners, which had only only owned the
OL,16,Fretailer for 18 months.
OL,23,APub: 07-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
