OL,3,GNEWSABoots sold in #7bn deal to
OL,4,ACanadian billionaire family
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe sale means another change of hands
OL,7,Ffor the company, which started as a
OL,8,Fsimple apothecary but has evolved to
OL,9,Fsell a vast range of health and beauty
OL,10,Fproducts, meal deals and travel
OL,11,Faccessories.
OL,13,FGalen Weston, chairman of Wittington,
OL,14,Fsaid Boots played "a vital role in
OL,15,Feveryday life across the UK and
OL,16,FIreland".
